{"op": "event", "utc": 1794842890.8142803, "event": "codex_jsonl", "line": "{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_83\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/usr/bin/bash -lc \\\"tail -5 /workspace/scratch/render.log && head -70 /workspace/submission/subtitles.srt && ls -lh /workspace/submission && date -u '+%H:%M:%S'\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"[libx264 @ 0x574ad1b152c0] ref P L0: 71.9% 28.1%\\n[libx264 @ 0x574ad1b152c0] ref B L0: 82.9% 17.1%\\n[libx264 @ 0x574ad1b152c0] ref B L1: 95.6%  4.4%\\n[libx264 @ 0x574ad1b152c0] kb/s:2175.56\\n[aac @ 0x574ad2943200] Qavg: 2667.320\\n1\\n00:00:05,302 --> 00:00:07,050\\n这是一只宽尾树莺。\\n\\n2\\n00:00:07,518 --> 00:00:11,427\\n棕褐色的背部、短圆的翅膀和较长的尾巴，\\n\\n3\\n00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,093\\n是辨认它的线索。\\n\\n4\\n00:00:16,102 --> 00:00:19,022\\n画面呈现的是一张近距离照片，\\n\\n5\\n00:00:19,175 --> 00:00:22,134\\n不能据此判断，它是否正在鸣叫。\\n\\n6\\n00:00:29,102 --> 00:00:32,217\\n原声中，短促的叫声成串重复，\\n\\n7\\n00:00:32,435 --> 00:00:34,522\\n后来又出现更高的音节。\\n\\n8\\n00:00:35,003 --> 00:00:36,607\\n照片与声音之间，\\n\\n9\\n00:00:36,734 --> 00:00:38,547\\n无法核对嘴部动作。\\n\\n10\\n00:00:49,902 --> 00:00:52,483\\n灌木丛里，鸟儿没有清楚露面。\\n\\n11\\n00:00:52,964 --> 00:00:55,740\\n这一段，暂判断为宽尾树莺。\\n\\n12\\n00:01:01,602 --> 00:01:03,154\\n短音反复出现，\\n\\n13\\n00:01:03,282 --> 00:01:04,925\\n还夹着较急的颤音。\\n\\n14\\n00:01:05,393 --> 00:01:06,919\\n枝叶挡住了鸟体，\\n\\n15\\n00:01:07,086 --> 00:01:09,380\\n无法确认发声的具体个体。\\n\\n16\\n00:01:19,102 --> 00:01:22,061\\n枝头这只，暂判断为柳纹霸鹟。\\n\\n17\\n00:01:22,542 --> 00:01:24,159\\n灰橄榄色的上体、\\n\\n18\\n00:01:24,273 --> 00:01:26,711\\ntotal 70M\\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 1000 1000 4.7K Nov 16 15:27 assemble_media.py\\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 1000 1000  53M Nov 16 15:28 final.mp4\\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 1000 1000  765 Nov 16 15:27 mix_report.json\\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 1000 1000  17M Nov 16 15:27 narration.wav\\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 1000 1000  13K Nov 16 15:25 research_log.json\\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 1000 1000 2.8K Nov 16 15:27 subtitles.srt\\n-rwxrwxrwx 1 1000 1000 3.4K Nov 16 15:25 synthesize_narration.py\\n15:28:10\\n\",\