{"op": "event", "utc": 1794842961.0005643, "event": "codex_jsonl", "line": "{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_86\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/usr/bin/bash -lc \\\"tail -65 /workspace/submission/subtitles.srt && cat /workspace/scratch/narr_12.mp3.json | tail -35 && date -u '+%H:%M:%S'\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\\n27\\n00:01:59,050 --> 00:02:02,255\\n这类歌声，是辨认苇莺的重要线索。\\n\\n28\\n00:02:08,402 --> 00:02:09,993\\n这是黑脚信天翁。\\n\\n29\\n00:02:10,461 --> 00:02:13,368\\n成鸟通体深褐，嘴基有浅色。\\n\\n30\\n00:02:13,834 --> 00:02:15,907\\n绒羽蓬松的雏鸟张着嘴，\\n\\n31\\n00:02:16,126 --> 00:02:18,420\\n现场有一串短促的叫声。\\n\\n32\\n00:02:24,302 --> 00:02:27,339\\n成鸟低下头，与雏鸟嘴部接触，\\n\\n33\\n00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:29,058\\n呈现喂食的动作。\\n\\n34\\n00:02:29,539 --> 00:02:32,015\\n信天翁通常以反刍的方式，\\n\\n35\\n00:02:32,130 --> 00:02:33,851\\n把食物送给雏鸟。\\n\\n36\\n00:02:42,502 --> 00:02:44,328\\n最后是黑背信天翁，\\n\\n37\\n00:02:44,455 --> 00:02:45,968\\n也叫莱桑信天翁。\\n\\n38\\n00:02:46,450 --> 00:02:48,249\\n白色的头颈和腹部，\\n\\n39\\n00:02:48,442 --> 00:02:51,205\\n与深色的背翅形成鲜明对比。\\n\\n40\\n00:02:55,202 --> 00:02:57,653\\n两只鸟相对点头、伸颈，\\n\\n41\\n00:02:57,832 --> 00:02:59,762\\n做出求偶展示的动作。\\n\\n42\\n00:03:00,243 --> 00:03:04,243\\n原声中，鸣声与急促的敲击声交替出现。\\n\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"Metadata\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"Type\\\": \\\"WordBoundary\\\",\\n          \\\"Data\\\": {\\n            \\\"Offset\\\": 81380410,\\n            \\\"Duration\\\": 3776250,\\n            \\\"text\\\": {\\n              \\\"Text\\\": \\\"交替\\\",\\n              \\\"Length\\\": 2,\\n              \\\"BoundaryType\\\": \\\"WordBoundary\\\"\\n            }\\n          }\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"Metadata\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"Type\\\": \\\"WordBoundary\\\",\\n          \\\"Data\\\": {\\n            \\\"Offset\\\": 85286660,\\n            \\\"Duration\\\": 4947910,\\n            \\\"text\\\": {\\n              \\\"Text\\\": \\\"出现\\\",\\n              \\\"Length\\\": 2,\\n              \\\"BoundaryType\\\": \\\"WordBoundary\\\"\\n            }\\n          }\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}15:28:44\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}"}
